      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5461820230899e48deb1db7d04800fc2701e9872e3852ca4479c5239653ba169",
      "text": "Day 12 · Transfer to Honduras and visit the famous Maya ruins of Copán, renowned for the beauty and precision of its stelae, some carved almost in the round, which earned it the name “Athens of Mesoamerica”. Its masterpiece is the Hieroglyphic Stairway, whose 63 steps carry the longest known Maya inscription, flanked by balustrades decorated with serpents and birds. Overnight at Hotel Clarion Copán Ruinas. (B)",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
